        "title": "Connectedness",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "EXAMPLES:\n  Connected: R, [a,b], Rⁿ, Sⁿ, T², any interval.\n  NOT connected: {0,1} (discrete), (0,1)∪(2,3), Q (topologically disconnected)."
    },
